# The raw sources are large and redistributable only from their publishers;
# the scripts that turn them into the shipped datasets are not, and are kept.
# Must exclude the contents rather than the directory: git cannot re-include
# a file whose parent directory is itself excluded.
data-raw/*
!data-raw/*.R
inst/doc
vignettes/*.html
paper/*.pdf
paper/*.aux
paper/*.log
paper/*.out
paper/*.rds
